name: sim.getModuleName
description: 
luaSynopsis: string moduleName,int moduleVersion=sim.getModuleName(int index)
pythonSynopsis: string moduleName,int moduleVersion=sim.getModuleName(int index)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. index: index to a module. To list-up all module names, start with index=0 and increment index until return value is nil
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. moduleName: name of the module or nil if no module is available at that index position.
2. moduleVersion: version of the plugin
